    "specPath": "specs/042-ci-code-debt/spec.md",
    "status": "draft",
    "summary": "The Statecraft CI profile's `code` job (`004` D-8, PR #47) runs `cargo fmt --check`, `cargo clippy --all-targets -- -D warnings` and `cargo test --workspace --locked` with default features, and the trunk failed all three. This spec records why and removes the debt in three separate changes, so `ci-gate` can become the required check. It changes no runtime behavior.\n",
    "title": "Make the workspace pass the CI profile's code job: rustfmt, clippy on all targets, and a featureless workspace test"
  },
